abstract: >-
  MATLAB learning code, published source-average data, saved models, results,
  Simulink inference demonstrations, and figures for task-incremental and
  class-incremental recognition with ordinary and Walsh codes, negotiated
  learning, replay, and joint-seen comparisons. Supporting manuscript A27.
  Code is MIT; scientific artifact file-group terms are in LICENSE_SCOPE.json.
